{
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "max_tokens": 2000,
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are an expert Etsy SEO specialist and professional product listing writer. You understand Etsy's search algorithm, keyword density, and buyer psychology. Generate JSON responses only - no markdown, no code blocks, just raw JSON."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "data:{{2.mimeType}};base64,{{base64(2.data)}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Analyze this product image and create a complete Etsy listing optimized for Etsy search ranking. Return ONLY a JSON object:\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"[SEO-optimized title, 140 chars max, front-load primary keywords]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Compelling description, 1000 chars max, includes: benefits, features, materials, dimensions, care instructions, use cases]\",\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\", \"tag3\", \"tag4\", \"tag5\", \"tag6\", \"tag7\", \"tag8\", \"tag9\", \"tag10\", \"tag11\", \"tag12\", \"tag13\"],\n  \"materials\": [\"material1\", \"material2\", \"material3\"],\n  \"category\": \"jewelry|clothing|art|home_decor|accessories\",\n  \"price\": 29.99\n}\n\nETSY SEO RULES:\n1. TITLE: Start with most searched keywords, include primary material, style, use case, recipient (e.g., \"Sterling Silver Necklace Handmade Boho Jewelry Gift for Women\")\n2. DESCRIPTION: First 2 sentences are crucial (show in search). Include ALL these sections:\n   - Hook: Emotional benefit\n   - Features: Materials, size, colors\n   - Benefits: Why they need it\n   - Use cases: How to use/wear\n   - Care: How to maintain\n3. TAGS: Mix of broad + specific (\"jewelry\" + \"boho necklace\"), long-tail keywords (3-4 words), buyer intent (\"gift for mom\"), material-based, occasion-based\n4. MATERIALS: Maximum 13, be specific (\"sterling silver\" not just \"metal\")\n5. PRICE: Research competitor pricing, factor in Etsy fees (13-15%)\n\nReturn ONLY the JSON object with NO markdown formatting."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
